assurance for occasional small leaks during daily activities.<br>COLOUR: Dark Grey<br>BODY FABRIC: 100% cotton, with additional absorbent and protective layers<br>ABSORBENCY: Up to 40 ml*</p><table><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S&ndash;XL</td><td>&#8377;499</td></tr><tr><td>2XL&ndash;6XL</td><td>&#8377;599</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Your flow. Your fit. Your Dexte comfort.</p><p>Absorbency and wear time vary with flow and use. Change sooner whenever damp, saturated or uncomfortable. Absorbency capacity does not guarantee leak-free wear for a fixed number of hours.</p>', description = '', meta_title = 'Cotton Period Panty - Dark Grey | DEXTE', meta_description = 'Shop DEXTE cotton period panties in Dark Grey. Sizes S to 6XL; Rs. 499 up to XL and Rs. 599 for 2XL to 6XL.' WHERE id = 31;

UPDATE tbl_products SET price = 1850.00, special_price = 0.00, discount = 0, absorbency_volume = 'Up to 60 ml', short_description = '<p>DEXTE PERIOD SHORTS<br>School days. Sports days. First-period days. Feel ready with Dexte.</p><p>Periods are a new experience. Feeling comfortable and prepared can make them easier. Dexte Period Shorts combine the coverage of shorts with built-in period protection&#8212;ideal under school uniforms, skirts and dresses, or as an extra layer under sportswear.</p><p>Made with soft, breathable bamboo fabric, they&#8217;re designed for girls starting their periods and teenagers who want comfortable protection as they move through their day.</p><h4>WHY GIRLS WILL LOVE THEM</h4><p><strong>Shorts-style coverage:</strong> Extra coverage under school skirts and dresses for comfortable movement.</p><p><strong>Beginner-friendly protection:</strong> A practical option for girls learning to manage their first periods.</p><p><strong>Wear without a pad:</strong> Built-in absorbent layers mean a separate pad isn&#8217;t always needed&#8212;choose according to flow.</p><p><strong>Ready for movement:</strong> Useful for PE, dance, playground activities and sports practice.</p><p><strong>Soft, breathable feel:</strong> Bamboo fabric offers comfortable everyday wear.</p><p><strong>Reusable protection:</strong> Wash and wear again, following the care instructions.</p><p><strong>Extra reassurance:</strong> Wear with a pad when additional backup is preferred.</p><h4>WHEN TO WEAR THEM</h4><p>Under school uniforms, skirts and dresses.</p><p>During the first few menstrual cycles, while learning your flow.</p><p>For PE classes, dance lessons and sports practice.</p><p>During tuition, outings, travel and school trips.</p><p>For spotting and lighter days towards the end of a period.</p><p>Around the expected start date, to stay prepared for an unexpected period.</p><p>While relaxing at home or resting, according to flow.</p><h4>PRODUCT DETAILS</h4><p>Detail</p><p>Description</p><p>Fabric</p><p>Breathable bamboo fabric with built-in absorbent and protective layers</p><p>Absorbency</p><p>Up to 60 ml*</p><p>Colour</p><p>Black</p><p>Sizes</p><h4>XS&#8211;2XL</h4><h4>MRP</h4><p>&#8377;1,850</p><h4>HOW LONG CAN THEY BE WORN WITHOUT A PAD?</h4><p><strong>Suggested wear window:</strong> 7&#8211;9 hours only when flow allows. This is not a fixed protection time. On days when flow is heavier, change sooner or use a pad for additional backup, changing the pad regularly.</p><p>For beginners, check regularly during the first few uses to understand how quickly the shorts fill. Always change if they feel wet, saturated or uncomfortable, or if leakage occurs. Keep a spare pair available for school and outings.</p><p>A little more coverage. A little more confidence. Ready for her day.</p><p>60 ml is the stated absorbency capacity, not a guarantee of wear time. Actual performance varies with flow, fit and activity. Follow the product&#8217;s washing and care instructions.</p>', description = '' WHERE id = 6;

UPDATE tbl_products SET price = 1850.00, special_price = 0.00, discount = 0, absorbency_volume = 'Up to 60 ml', short_description = '<p>DEXTE COMPRESSION-STYLE PERIOD SHORTS<br>Move with confidence. Stay focused on your workout.</p><p>From weight training and lifting to running, cycling, dance and gym sessions, Dexte Compression-Style Period Shorts bring together a snug, flexible fit and built-in period protection.</p><p>Stretch, move and train comfortably in breathable, stretchable fabric with a bamboo gusset and absorbent layers&#8212;designed to move with your body.</p><h4>WHY YOU&#8217;LL LOVE THEM</h4><p><strong>Snug, supportive feel:</strong> A compression-style fit for comfortable coverage during movement.</p><p><strong>Freedom to move:</strong> Stretchable fabric lets you bend, stretch, squat and run comfortably.</p><p><strong>Built-in period protection:</strong> Absorbency of up to 60 ml* for added reassurance during your period.</p><p><strong>Breathable comfort:</strong> Breathable body fabric with a bamboo gusset.</p><p><strong>Flexible protection:</strong> Wear without a pad when suitable for your flow, or with a pad for extra backup.</p><p><strong>Reusable convenience:</strong> Wash and wear again according to the care instructions.</p><h4>MADE FOR YOUR ACTIVE DAYS</h4><p>Wear for gym workouts, weight training, running, jogging, cycling, dance, yoga, Pilates, school PE and other land-based sports. Wear on their own where appropriate or under sportswear for additional coverage.</p><p>Product detail</p><p>Specification</p><p>Style</p><p>Compression-style period shorts</p><p>Body fabric</p><p>Stretchable, breathable fabric</p><p>Gusset</p><p>Bamboo</p><p>Absorbency</p><p>Up to 60 ml*</p><p>Sizes</p><h4>XS&#8211;2XL</h4><p>Price</p><p>&#8377;1,850</p><h4>WEAR ACCORDING TO YOUR FLOW</h4><p>Check regularly, especially during your first few uses. Change sooner if the shorts feel wet, saturated or uncomfortable, or if leakage occurs. For heavier flow or longer sessions, carry a spare pair and use a pad for additional backup if needed.</p><p>Your movement. Your strength. Your Dexte comfort.</p><p>The stated 60 ml capacity should be supported by product testing. Wear time varies with flow, fit and activity. The compression-style fit offers a snug feel; it does not replace lifting equipment or provide protection against injury.</p>', description = '' WHERE id = 7;

UPDATE tbl_products SET absorbency_volume = '40-50 ml', short_description = '<p>DEXTE SEAMLESS PERIOD PANTY<br>A smooth fit under your outfit. Extra reassurance through your day.</p><p>Lightweight and comfortable, Dexte Seamless Period Panty combines a smooth silhouette with built-in absorbent protection. Its nylon outer fabric and soft bamboo inner gusset make it a practical choice for periods, spotting and occasional light urinary leaks.</p><p>Wear under dresses, skirts, trousers or everyday outfits for discreet coverage as you go about your day.</p><h4>WHY YOU&#8217;LL LOVE IT</h4><p><strong>Smooth under clothing:</strong> Seamless construction helps minimise visible panty lines.</p><p><strong>Lightweight comfort:</strong> Comfortable coverage for work, travel and daily activities.</p><p><strong>Built-in absorbency:</strong> A stated capacity of 40&#8211;50 ml*.</p><p><strong>Soft inner feel:</strong> Bamboo fabric at the inner gusset.</p><p><strong>Flexible protection:</strong> Wear without a pad when suitable for your flow, or pair with a pad for extra backup.</p><p><strong>Washable and reusable:</strong> Wear again following the product&#8217;s care instructions.</p><h4>HOW YOU CAN USE IT</h4><p><strong>For periods:</strong> Wear on its own when the absorbency suits your flow. Check regularly and change before it becomes saturated.</p><p><strong>For heavy-flow days:</strong> Pair with a pad for additional backup against overflow. Change the pad regularly; change the panty too if damp or saturated.</p><p><strong>For spotting:</strong> Useful for light staining before your period, towards its end or between cycles.</p><p><strong>For everyday vaginal discharge:</strong> Can help absorb normal discharge. Change whenever damp to stay comfortable; it does not treat the cause of discharge.</p><p><strong>For occasional light urinary leakage:</strong> Added reassurance for small leaks during everyday activities. It is not intended for complete bladder emptying.</p><p><strong>Under dresses and fitted outfits:</strong> A smooth, discreet option when you want absorbent protection with less visible underwear lines.</p><p>Product detail</p><p>Specification</p><p>Style</p><p>Lightweight, seamless period panty</p><p>Outer fabric</p><p>Nylon</p><p>Inner gusset</p><p>Bamboo</p><p>Absorbency</p><p>40&#8211;50 ml*</p><p>Sizes</p><h4>XS&#8211;3XL</h4><h4>MRP</h4><p>&#8377;999</p><h4>CHOOSE YOUR WEAR TIME BY YOUR FLOW</h4><p>There is no fixed wear time for everyone. Check regularly during your first few uses and change if wet, saturated or uncomfortable, or if leakage occurs. Carry a spare pair for longer days away from home.</p><p>Smooth under your dress. Comfortable through your day.</p><p>Stated absorbency should be supported by product testing. Actual performance varies with flow, fit and activity.</p>', description = '' WHERE id = 1;

UPDATE tbl_products SET absorbency_volume = '40-50 ml', short_description = '<p>DEXTE SEAMLESS PERIOD PANTY<br>A smooth fit under your outfit. Extra reassurance through your day.</p><p>Lightweight and comfortable, Dexte Seamless Period Panty combines a smooth silhouette with built-in absorbent protection. Its nylon outer fabric and soft bamboo inner gusset make it a practical choice for periods, spotting and occasional light urinary leaks.</p><p>Wear under dresses, skirts, trousers or everyday outfits for discreet coverage as you go about your day.</p><h4>WHY YOU&#8217;LL LOVE IT</h4><p><strong>Smooth under clothing:</strong> Seamless construction helps minimise visible panty lines.</p><p><strong>Lightweight comfort:</strong> Comfortable coverage for work, travel and daily activities.</p><p><strong>Built-in absorbency:</strong> A stated capacity of 40&#8211;50 ml*.</p><p><strong>Soft inner feel:</strong> Bamboo fabric at the inner gusset.</p><p><strong>Flexible protection:</strong> Wear without a pad when suitable for your flow, or pair with a pad for extra backup.</p><p><strong>Washable and reusable:</strong> Wear again following the product&#8217;s care instructions.</p><h4>HOW YOU CAN USE IT</h4><p><strong>For periods:</strong> Wear on its own when the absorbency suits your flow. Check regularly and change before it becomes saturated.</p><p><strong>For heavy-flow days:</strong> Pair with a pad for additional backup against overflow. Change the pad regularly; change the panty too if damp or saturated.</p><p><strong>For spotting:</strong> Useful for light staining before your period, towards its end or between cycles.</p><p><strong>For everyday vaginal discharge:</strong> Can help absorb normal discharge. Change whenever damp to stay comfortable; it does not treat the cause of discharge.</p><p><strong>For occasional light urinary leakage:</strong> Added reassurance for small leaks during everyday activities. It is not intended for complete bladder emptying.</p><p><