UPDATE tbl_products SET absorbency_volume = '40-50 ml', short_description = '<p>DEXTE SEAMLESS PERIOD PANTY<br>A smooth fit under your outfit. Extra reassurance through your day.</p><p>Lightweight and comfortable, Dexte Seamless Period Panty combines a smooth silhouette with built-in absorbent protection. Its nylon outer fabric and soft bamboo inner gusset make it a practical choice for periods, spotting and occasional light urinary leaks.</p><p>Wear under dresses, skirts, trousers or everyday outfits for discreet coverage as you go about your day.</p><h4>WHY YOU&#8217;LL LOVE IT</h4><p><strong>Smooth under clothing:</strong> Seamless construction helps minimise visible panty lines.</p><p><strong>Lightweight comfort:</strong> Comfortable coverage for work, travel and daily activities.</p><p><strong>Built-in absorbency:</strong> A stated capacity of 40&#8211;50 ml*.</p><p><strong>Soft inner feel:</strong> Bamboo fabric at the inner gusset.</p><p><strong>Flexible protection:</strong> Wear without a pad when suitable for your flow, or pair with a pad for extra backup.</p><p><strong>Washable and reusable:</strong> Wear again following the product&#8217;s care instructions.</p><h4>HOW YOU CAN USE IT</h4><p><strong>For periods:</strong> Wear on its own when the absorbency suits your flow. Check regularly and change before it becomes saturated.</p><p><strong>For heavy-flow days:</strong> Pair with a pad for additional backup against overflow. Change the pad regularly; change the panty too if damp or saturated.</p><p><strong>For spotting:</strong> Useful for light staining before your period, towards its end or between cycles.</p><p><strong>For everyday vaginal discharge:</strong> Can help absorb normal discharge. Change whenever damp to stay comfortable; it does not treat the cause of discharge.</p><p><strong>For occasional light urinary leakage:</strong> Added reassurance for small leaks during everyday activities. It is not intended for complete bladder emptying.</p><p><strong>Under dresses and fitted outfits:</strong> A smooth, discreet option when you want absorbent protection with less visible underwear lines.</p><p>Product detail</p><p>Specification</p><p>Style</p><p>Lightweight, seamless period panty</p><p>Outer fabric</p><p>Nylon</p><p>Inner gusset</p><p>Bamboo</p><p>Absorbency</p><p>40&#8211;50 ml*</p><p>Sizes</p><h4>XS&#8211;3XL</h4><h4>MRP</h4><p>&#8377;999</p><h4>CHOOSE YOUR WEAR TIME BY YOUR FLOW</h4><p>There is no fixed wear time for everyone. Check regularly during your first few uses and change if wet, saturated or uncomfortable, or if leakage occurs. Carry a spare pair for longer days away from home.</p><p>Smooth under your dress. Comfortable through your day.</p><p>Stated absorbency should be supported by product testing. Actual performance varies with flow, fit and activity.</p>', description = '' WHERE id = 10;

